  "rationale": "Use a small sensor plant plus a motion-capability plant, then encode the exploration policy in compact deterministic specifications. The policy gives priority to forward progress in clear space, inserts occasional brief random_walk for coverage variation, uses directed one-shot turns for side/front obstacles, allows a rare one-shot backward escape only after front blockage, and reserves full_rotate for a dedicated last-resort stuck state after repeated front-blocked recovery failure.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate sensing and actuation in G; encode safe exploration and recovery sequencing in E",
    "Bias clear-space behavior toward move_forward, use random_walk only occasionally, and return to forward exploration immediately on path_clear after recovery"
